][/dim]good enough to act on, and exits non-zero when any target failed, [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]is blocked on a human, or timed out.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]4[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]4[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202608/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]agent_wait_command.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202608/agent_wait_command.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]sase-s8[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/sase-org/sase--beads/blob/main/pages/sase-s8/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Wait target resolution and settle engine[/bold #D7AFFF]                      [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]engine[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]engine: build the presentation-neutral wait engine — resolve names to [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]wait units, classify each unit per tick from one artifact snapshot, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]decide when the wait settles and with which outcome.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]sase agent wait command and exit-code contract[/bold #D7AFFF]                [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]cli[dim] · [dim][/dim]after engine[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]cli: register the subcommand, wire target selection and self-exclusion, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]implement the exit-code contract, and ship the non-TTY, JSON, and quiet [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]output modes so the command is fully usable.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Live TTY display and settle summary[/bold #D7AFFF]                           [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]live[dim] · [dim][/dim]after cli[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]live: add the refreshing TTY panel, the per-target \"why it is not done\" [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]column, terminal-blocker warnings, the final settle summary with inspect[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]pointers, and signal-safe teardown.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Documentation, help polish, and integrated verification[/bold #D7AFFF]       [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]docs[dim] · [dim][/dim]after live[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]docs: document the command and the monitor gate idiom, polish help text [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and examples, and verify the whole feature end to end with `just [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]check-full`.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-s8","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-5.5","patch_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","phase_bead_id":"sase-s8.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-196a15812a2822a4afee74cc99759eae","started_at":"2026-08-23T11:40:50.216353+00:00","state":"completed"},{"commits":[{"committed_at":1787498452,"sha":"42b900fa19de41fcee3bd8473385e46a567352ed","subject":"fix(agent): restore public is_terminal_state in wait_watch"}],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"chat":{"digest":"006c9438a06c06af1783db54e5620f09b9a0c09113f991a4ec38df04e7d7b37f","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-s8.land/chat.md","size_bytes":8346},"commits":{"digest":"4f686cd8399e04b943dc2a24004e9ea863557fbb0bf9a78470a84aade4f211fb","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-s8.land/commits.json","size_bytes":236},"embedded_workflows":{"digest":"a398c70160fe308637edd70b38d8cf02cc697183c480675d10f387d529663058","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-s8.land/embedded_workflows.json","size_bytes":80},"meta":{"digest":"8052fbee1302aaf5c9eeac8b27463c3ae7197cc77e45710b05ae8da29e6f21a1","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-s8.land/meta.json","size_bytes":607},"prompt":{"digest":"0fb5275e96b15